Setup			p3diso

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.1            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0e-3	Surface Density at r=1
Alpha			1.0e-4		Uniform kinematic viscosity
SigmaSlope		1.5		Slope of surface
FlaringIndex		0.5

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/jupiter.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.1		Smoothing parameters in disk thickness

### Numerical method parameters

Disk			YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			F
IndirectTerm		yes

### Mesh parameters

Nx			880		Azimuthal number of zones 
Ny               	369		Radial number of zones
Nz			56		Number of zones in colatitude
Ymin			0.3		Inner boundary radius
Ymax			5.0		Outer boundary radius
Spacing			log
Zmin			1.0
Zmax			1.570796327
Xmin			-3.141592653589793
Xmax			3.141592653589793

### Output control parameters

Ntot			10001		Total number of time steps
Ninterm	 		20		Time steps between outputs
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length. 2PI = 1 orbit
OutputDir		@outputs/p3diso


Field 			gasdens
PlotLine		field[-1,:,:]
